---
import SectionHeader from './SectionHeader.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="relative">
  <SectionHeader
    index="05"
    label="About"
    title="An engineer. A teacher. Still a student."
    kicker="Background."
    space="loose"
  />

  <div class="max-w-page mx-auto px-6 md:px-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-0 md:gap-x-8 gap-y-14">
      <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-7 md:col-start-2 fade-up">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.85] text-ink">
            I'm a licensed Electronics Engineer who ended up in data and AI. Over
            the past 8+ years, I've done computer vision and robotics research,
            taught at De La Salle University, and built data systems for companies.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-5 text-[15px] leading-[1.85] text-muted">
            Before going independent in late 2023, I led the data engineering and
            data science teams at a tech company in the Philippines. Since then, I've worked with
            clients abroad, mostly on data pipelines, AI applications, and getting
            their tools to work together.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-5 text-[15px] leading-[1.85] text-muted">
            I like building things that keep working after the demo. If I can't
            explain how something works, or fix it when it breaks, I don't think
            it's done.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-5 text-[15px] leading-[1.85] text-muted">
            Outside client work, I write about what I'm learning and make free
            roadmaps for people getting into data. I had to piece a lot of it
            together on my own when I started, so I try to make it a bit easier
            for whoever comes next.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-4 md:col-start-9 fade-up" style="--stagger: 1;">
        <div>
          <p class="mono-label">Timeline</p>
          <ul
            class="mt-5 divide-y divide-border text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed"
          >
            <li class="py-5">
              <span class="block mono-label mb-1.5">NOW</span>
              <span class="text-ink">Freelance Data &amp; AI/ML Engineer, Salamanca, Spain.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="py-5">
              <span class="block mono-label mb-1.5">CLIENTS, 2023–</span>
              <span class="text-ink">Over the years, firms in AU, UK, US &amp; CA across software, real estate, marketing, and eCom.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="py-5">
              <span class="block mono-label mb-1.5">LED</span>
              <span class="text-ink">DE &amp; DS teams at a PH tech firm (2022–2023).</span>
            </li>
            <li class="py-5">
              <span class="block mono-label mb-1.5">PAST</span>
              <span class="text-ink">AI researcher &amp; DLSU lecturer; IEEE-published in computer vision &amp; robotics.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="py-5">
              <span class="block mono-label mb-1.5">NEXT</span>
              <span class="text-ink">Keep building useful things, and keep learning new ones.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>


        <div class="mt-12">
          <p class="mono-label">Free resources</p>
          <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3.5 text-[14px]">
            <li>
              <a
                href="https://shadow-blue-572.notion.site/c3f88e41209349f6a0a18c40684a420a"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
                class="group flex items-start justify-between gap-3 text-ink hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity"
              >
                <span class="flex-1">Data Analyst Roadmap</span>
                <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 mt-1 text-subtle transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8"></path></svg>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a
                href="https://shadow-blue-572.notion.site/b880b4ef0b1445aabec127442b97c79f?v=0a45fb3e2b5946d59708797eeea16671"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
                class="group flex items-start justify-between gap-3 text-ink hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity"
              >
                <span class="flex-1">Data Engineer Roadmap</span>
                <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 mt-1 text-subtle transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8"></path></svg>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
